From cfadfff8274970a33fb96332b8fda29c80c723da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:04:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): isolate draft display without changing send
 workspace [daveey]

Keep first-send cwd equal to the pre-PR target/Home/current/fallback
computation. A display-only selector retains the main draft's placement
while a center tile borrows Files' cwd; deliberate workspace choices clear
that borrowing in the existing chosen-cwd setter.

Regression coverage compares session.create to an independent pre-PR cwd
oracle across every workspace writer, including project entry after a tile,
same-path choices, round trips and tile closure. Five regression cases fail
on the prior head; focused repaired tests pass.
